---
// Andorra Private – Homepage
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Andorra Private | Europe’s most private high-altitude address</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A refined mountain principality for those who value discretion, space, and a quieter form of luxury." />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
      :root {
        --forest: #1A2F23;
        --stone: #E8E0D5;
        --offwhite: #F7F4EF;
        --charcoal: #1C1C1C;
        --brass: #B08D57;
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        background: var(--offwhite);
        color: var(--charcoal);
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      h1, h2, h3 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      /* Navigation */
      nav {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        padding: 2rem 7%;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        z-index: 20;
      }

      .logo {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        margin-left: 2.4rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: white;
      }

      /* Hero */
      .hero {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 7%;
        background: 
          linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(20, 32, 26, 0.45), rgba(20, 32, 26, 0.72)),
          url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?q=80&w=2670&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
        color: white;
        position: relative;
      }

      .hero-content {
        max-width: 680px;
        padding-top: 4rem;
      }

      .hero-label {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.28em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        opacity: 0.85;
        margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 5.8vw, 4.6rem);
        margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 1.12rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        max-width: 480px;
        opacity: 0.92;
        margin-bottom: 2.6rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .hero-cta {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.95rem 2.1rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        transition: all 0.25s ease;
      }

      .hero-cta:hover {
        background: white;
        color: var(--forest);
      }

      /* Why Andorra Section */
      .why {
        padding: 7rem 7%;
        background: var(--offwhite);
      }

      .why-header {
        max-width: 620px;
        margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
      }

      .why-header h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--forest);
      }

      .why-header p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: #555;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .pillars {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 2.5rem;
      }

      .pillar {
        background: white;
        padding: 2.4rem 2rem;
        border: 1px solid #eae6df;
      }

      .pillar-number {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        color: var(--brass);
        margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
      }

      .pillar h3 {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--forest);
      }

      .pillar p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #555;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <nav>
      <a href="/" class="logo">Andorra Private</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#lifestyle">Lifestyle</a>
        <a href="#living">Living Here</a>
        <a href="#residencies">Residencies</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-label">The Principality</div>
        <h1>Europe’s most private<br>high-altitude address</h1>
        <p>A refined mountain principality for those who value discretion, space, and a quieter form of luxury.</p>
        <a href="#residencies" class="hero-cta">Explore Residencies</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="why" id="lifestyle">
      <div class="why-header">
        <h2>Why Andorra</h2>
        <p>Not another alpine resort town. A sovereign principality with genuine privacy, remarkable quality of life, and a scale that still feels human.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar-number">01</div>
          <h3>True Privacy</h3>
          <p>One of Europe’s most discreet jurisdictions. A place where wealth does not need to announce itself.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar-number">02</div>
          <h3>Mountain Living</h3>
          <p>Dramatic Pyrenean landscape with exceptional air quality, outdoor access, and a slower daily rhythm.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar-number">03</div>
          <h3>Favourable Framework</h3>
          <p>Attractive tax residency options, political stability, and a clear path for long-term living.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar-number">04</div>
          <h3>Human Scale</h3>
          <p>Small enough to feel personal, sophisticated enough to feel complete. No crowds, no noise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
